@startuml bookingSequenceDiagram

actor User
participant "Booking Page" as BookingPage
participant "Backend Service" as BackendService
participant "Database" as Database

User -> BookingPage: Open booking page
BookingPage -> BackendService: Request available slots: GET /api/bookings
BackendService -> Database: Query available slots
Database --> BackendService: Return available slots
BackendService --> BookingPage: Display available slots

User -> BookingPage: Select a slot and submit booking
BookingPage -> BackendService: Submit booking details POST /api/booking
BackendService -> Database: Save booking details
Database --> BackendService: Confirm booking saved
BackendService --> BookingPage: Display booking confirmation
